VUE_APP_DESCRIPTION=The Xiaozhi backend service (xiaozhi-server) is a backend service system for smart-terminal hardware and software, developed under the lead of Professor Liu Siyuan's team at South China University of Technology. It is built for the xiaozhi-esp32 open-source hardware and offers core capabilities such as multi-protocol compatibility, voiceprint recognition and knowledge base management.
VUE_APP_KEYWORDS=xiaozhi-server, Xiaozhi server, control console, AI hardware, smart hardware, AI toys, emotional companionship, chatbot, smart home, in-vehicle robot
